ou flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":38,"line":"Carolina shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":38,"line":"Rafael hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":38,"line":"A runner from The Red Table, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":39,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Carolina says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":39,"line":"Carolina shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":40,"line":"⛓️ Casey brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":41,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":42,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":42,"line":"You accept Emberhold's food — 1,975 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Ines clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":42,"line":"⛓️ Casey brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":43,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who