ckles hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Gertrude looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the west ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A runner from Ashford, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1235 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Alejandra hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1238 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"You sit everyone down. You listen. Nobody yells. (mediator: village trust +12)"},{"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Gertrude hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Gertrude hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1239 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Gertrude hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":23,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":23,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the west. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":24,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the west. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":30,"line":"Alejandra saw how close you've gotten to Harper. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":30,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":34,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Diplomatic Incident (Level 1). Trust builds 2x faster. You're TOO good though — once per week you can start a diplomatic incident: villagers argue, you pick the winner (+trust with them, -trust with the loser)."},{"day":34,"line":"At the grave, Rocco, Harper, Aroha and 2 more speak for Gertrude — \"Alejandra trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":35,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":35,"line":"A runner from The Bloodied, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the north ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Bloodied came in the night from the north. They carried off ~1400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":36,"line":"A runner from The Red Table, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":37,"line":"⛓️ Harper brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":37,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the west. They carried off ~700 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":38,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":38,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Bloodied came in the night from the north. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":39,"line":"⛓️ Harper brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":39,"line":"A runner from The Hungry Road, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":40,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":40,"line":"⛓️ Harper brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":40,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":41,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":41,"line":"You accept Thornfield's food — 2,558 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Talia clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":41,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":41,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,552 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,649 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":43,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,552 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":43,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the west. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the