(Trust -10.)"},{"day":94,"line":"✨ Ability gained: Loud Chewer (L1). Eating is 2x louder (monsters hear you). But villagers love eating beside you: trust builds 10% faster."},{"day":94,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,583 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":95,"line":"At the grave, Hazel, Sofia, Elijah and 1 more speak for Dmitri — \"Colton trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":95,"line":"◈ Dmitri Sokolov walks out of the light alone, which is how he walked in — and the galaxy, which came to watch a monster, leaves afraid of the right things. The fear is a shield now, held over a village that trusts the hand that holds it."}],"callLines":[],"heraldAttempts":[],"musterRefusals":[],"musterCalls":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0},"musterErrs":0,"musterErrors":[],"instrumentErrors":[],"maxWave":4,"wave4":1,"wave5":0,"w4Day":63,"w5Day":null,"national":1,"table":1,"won":1,"days":95,"gameDays":95,"endReason":"over-other","endScaleRank":"national","deaths":[{"day":6,"kind":"monster","who":"hushwolf","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":12,"kind":"monster","who":"sunback","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":14,"kind":"monster","who":"living_wire","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":14,"kind":"person","who":"gen_s2lpdkk","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":14,"kind":"monster","who":"speedbump_turtle","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":14,"kind":"monster","who":"glasswing","cause":"expedition","player":false},{"day":18,"kind":"monster","who":"hushwolf","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":20,"kind":"monster","who":"glasswing","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":22,"kind":"monster","who":"hummice","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":23,"kind":"monster","who":"hushwolf","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":