 link already grieves — the grief is priced in; the new speaker inherits the same table."}],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null},{"id":"link_mgpsphxb777","villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","status":"active","kind":null,"trust":60,"opinion":41,"arrears":0,"lastKeptDay":84,"mourningUntil":98,"tributePaidWeek":-1,"pendingRenegotiation":false,"conquered":false,"linkDay":26,"historyNew":[{"day":91,"kind":"succession","note":"Another death while the link already grieves — the grief is priced in; the new speaker inherits the same table."}],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null},{"id":"link_mgpsphyi298","villageId":"village_spl_23_2266","name":"The Red Table","status":"active","kind":null,"trust":52,"opinion":44,"arrears":0,"lastKeptDay":84,"mourningUntil":98,"tributePaidWeek":-1,"pendingRenegotiation":false,"conquered":false,"linkDay":28,"historyNew":[{"day":91,"kind":"succession","note":"Another death while the link already grieves — the grief is priced in; the new speaker inherits the same table."}],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null}]},{"day":92,"links":[{"id":"link_mgpsphwt889","villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","status":"active","kind":null,"trust":68,"opinion":46,"arrears":0,"lastKeptDay":84,"mourningUntil":98,"tributePaidWeek":-1,"pendingRenegotiation":false,"conquered":false,"linkDay":25,"historyNew":[{"day":91,"kind":"tribute","note":"Stonebridge rode in ready to pay; waved home — our shelves are full past tomorrow. (Waiver: the week counts paid, no arrears.)"}],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null},{"id":"link_mgpsphxb777","villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","status":"active","kind":null,"trust":60,"opinion":41,"arrears":0,"lastKeptDay":84,"mourningUntil":98,"tributePaidWeek":-1,"pendingRenegotiation":false,"conquered":false,"linkDay":26,"historyNew":[{"day":91,"kind":"tribute","note":"Thornfield rode in ready to pay; waved home — our shelves are full past tomorrow. (Waiver: the week counts paid, no arrears.)"}],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null},{"id":"link_mgpsphyi298","villageId":"village_spl_23_2266","name":"The Red Table","status":"active","kind":null,"trust":52,"opinion":44,"arrears":0,"lastKeptDay":84,"mourningUntil":98,"tributePaidWeek":-1,"pendingRenegotiation":false,"conquered":false,"linkDay":28,"historyNew":[{"day":91,"kind":"tribute","note":"The Red Table rode in ready to pay; waved home — our shelves are full past tomorrow. (Waiver: the week counts paid, no arrears.)"}],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null}]}],"trustLines":[{"day":1,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 30s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 30s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 30s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 50s, with a gap-toothed grin says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":3,"line":"A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Village meal: +1020 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Darnell looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A man, maybe 50s, with a scarred cheek hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Jerome hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Jerome hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the north ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":7,"line":"◈ FLASHBACK — Notebook\nRoute optimizations, glitch lists, apocalypse patch notes. 'DO NOT TRUST THE CACHE BY THE RIVER.' Your magnum opus, half-finished."},{"day":9,"line":"A runner from Ashford, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Earl counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"2 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":13,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":13,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the west ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Tashi: \"It offered me something. A... gift? I said no. I don't trust gifts from the sky.\""},{"day":14,"line":"Izabela hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":16,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the north. They carried off ~700 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":24,"line":"At the grave, Leonardo speaks for Darnell — \"Jerome trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Leonardo brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Leonardo brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":27,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 2,504 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Oscar clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"⛓️ Liam brings it home: The Red Table bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":28,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from The Red Table turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"Tha