."},{"day":90,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the west. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":91,"line":"At the grave, Elena, Tashi, Petra and 1 more speak for Leo — \"Naoki trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":91,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":91,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":91,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from The Red Table turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":92,"line":"◈ Leo Martin walks out of the light alone, which is how he walked in — and the galaxy, which came to watch a monster, leaves afraid of the right things. The fear is a shield now, held over a village that trusts the hand that holds it."}],"callLines":[],"heraldAttempts":[],"musterRefusals":[],"musterCalls":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0},"musterErrs":0,"musterErrors":[],"instrumentErrors":[],"maxWave":4,"wave4":1,"wave5":0,"w4Day":73,"w5Day":null,"national":1,"table":1,"won":1,"days":92,"gameDays":92,"endReason":"over-other","endScaleRank":"global","deaths":[{"day":4,"kind":"monster","who":"hummice","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":7,"kind":"monster","who":"hummice","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":7,"kind":"monster","who":"hummice","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":7,"kind":"monster","who":"hummice","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":7,"kind":"monster","who":"hummice","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":7,"kind":"monster","who":"hummice","cau