 our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":56,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":56,"line":"Village meal: +500 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":57,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":58,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":58,"line":"Village meal: +333 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":59,"line":"🍖 The feast is warm and good — but your reactor hums its steady note underneath, and the fire never catches. 1.25x, always, is all there is. (Feast buff refused: the reactor is a ceiling as well as a floor.)"},{"day":59,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":59,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Hungry Road came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1580 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":60,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":61,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":61,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":62,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,640 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother o