000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":27,"line":"⛓️ Ethan brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":27,"line":"Village meal: +1053 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"Village meal: +1040 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Kevin counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"day":29,"line":"Village meal: +1141 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":30,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+3510 kcal). Trust +7. They'll remember this."},{"day":30,"line":"Village meal: +1040 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":31,"line":"They take back the trust your gift earned. (Trust -7.)"},{"day":31,"line":"You took back what you gave. They noticed. Trust -5."},{"day":31,"line":"Kevin counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"day":31,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":31,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":32,"line":"You give Emberhold 1,600 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Priya weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":32,"line":"Kevin counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"day":32,"line":"Village meal: +1090 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":33,"line":"Village meal: +1065 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":34,"line":"Kevin counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first nu