Week":-1,"pendingRenegotiation":false,"conquered":false,"linkDay":25,"historyNew":[],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null},{"id":"link_mgpsphy2319","villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","status":"active","kind":null,"trust":100,"opinion":31,"arrears":0,"lastKeptDay":85,"mourningUntil":85,"tributePaidWeek":-1,"pendingRenegotiation":false,"conquered":false,"linkDay":26,"historyNew":[],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null}]},{"day":89,"links":[{"id":"link_mgpsphxb559","villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","status":"active","kind":null,"trust":100,"opinion":31,"arrears":0,"lastKeptDay":85,"mourningUntil":85,"tributePaidWeek":-1,"pendingRenegotiation":false,"conquered":false,"linkDay":25,"historyNew":[],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null},{"id":"link_mgpsphy2319","villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","status":"active","kind":null,"trust":100,"opinion":33,"arrears":0,"lastKeptDay":85,"mourningUntil":85,"tributePaidWeek":-1,"pendingRenegotiation":false,"conquered":false,"linkDay":26,"historyNew":[],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null}]},{"day":90,"links":[{"id":"link_mgpsphxb559","villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","status":"active","kind":null,"trust":92,"opinion":31,"arrears":0,"lastKeptDay":85,"mourningUntil":97,"tributePaidWeek":-1,"pendingRenegotiation":false,"conquered":false,"linkDay":25,"historyNew":[{"day":90,"kind":"succession","note":"Stonebridge pressed tribute down in Haven's chaos."}],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null},{"id":"link_mgpsphy2319","villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","status":"active","kind":null,"trust":92,"opinion":33,"arrears":0,"lastKeptDay":85,"mourningUntil":97,"tributePaidWeek":-1,"pendingRenegotiation":false,"conquered":false,"linkDay":26,"historyNew":[{"day":90,"kind":"succession","note":"Thornfield pressed tribute down in Haven's chaos."}],"musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null}]}],"trustLines":[{"day":1,"line":"⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Deep Read! You don't just read trust — you read intent. Know what they'll do next. (Your knowledge of Reading People amplifies your open_book.)"},{"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Diplomatic Incident (Level 1). Trust builds 2x faster. You're TOO good though — once per week you can start a diplomatic incident: villagers argue, you pick the winner (+trust with them, -trust with the loser)."},{"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 30s, with a gap-toothed grin shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Village meal: +1080 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A person, maybe 30s, with a gap-toothed grin hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Cesar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1157 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Cesar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1290 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Tamika hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Tamika hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1150 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"You sit everyone down. You listen. Nobody yells. (mediator: village trust +10)"},{"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1050 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":9,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the east ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1021 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +1150 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":11,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Tamika counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 7 against.\""},{"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1290 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1294 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":14,"line":"At the grave, Cesar speaks for Tamika — \"Elijah trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":19,"line":"Salvatore saw how close you've gotten to Victor. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":19,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the east. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":23,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the east. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":23,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Oscar brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":25,"line":"(Village trust +5. Some trials are fought with talking.)"},{"day":25,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Oscar brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the east. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,688 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🍖 The feast is warm and good — full bellies, loud laughter — but no keepsake was channeled. The surge must be armed before a feast can carry it: hold a keepsake and channel first. (Feast buff refused: devotion gate.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,584 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,754 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute from Stonebridge arrives — 4,000 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":33,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":33,"line":"You accept Thornfield's food — 2,124 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Kenji clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,584 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,584 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves ar