Ursula, Fatima, Grace and 3 more speak for Gani — \"Lyubov trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":77,"line":"🍲 Haven opens the granary — 3,400 kcal, all it holds. An honest feast, not a grand one. They count it anyway. (Trust +7 with each — 3 grieving fire(s); theirs waits.)"},{"day":77,"line":"🌾 Tribute from Thornfield arrives — 2,110 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":77,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from Stonebridge this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +2,250 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":80,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from Stonebridge this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +2,250 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":86,"line":"You give Stonebridge 1,610 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Ibrahim weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":88,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Grave Robber (Level 1). You can loot the dead (villagers, monsters). Good gear. -15 trust if seen."},{"day":88,"line":"At the grave, Fatima, Grace, Omar and 2 more speak for Ursula — \"Gani trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":88,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":88,"line":"INNER VOICE: the others are already afraid. Fear is a kind of respect that doesn't ask for anything back. You could build something here — not on trust. On what people will do to stay on your good side. (Corruption starts at 20. The slope is yours to walk — or not.)"},{